<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-SRI LANKA SCORE EASY WIN VS NZ.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA SCORE EASY WIN VS NZ.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH, New Zealand 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka</p>
<p>beat New Zealand by six wickets in a limited over day-night</p>
<p>match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand: 201 for nine in 50 overs.</p>
<p>Sri Lanka: 202 for four in 35.5 overs .</p>
</text>
